	(text "CUSTOM — REVIEW REQUIRED: U200 symbol/land; Q200/Q201 approved custom lands"
		(at 45.72 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 255 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "223d6a4b-e846-43b1-9489-be42c7e67dc4")
	)
	(text "2S PACK PROTECTION — DEVELOPMENT / NOT COMMISSIONED"
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "47d390e2-2710-4349-970e-cb2d0eb6f565")
	)
	(text "Retained raw-cell domain; source is external cells/simulator.\nR200 is the ONLY intended metal join to system GND.\nNo USB/debug ground across shunt; use differential probes.\nMain-current connector/fuse and pack construction remain TBD."
		(at 25.4 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c8011cbc-33bd-4597-ac88-f8968fd60f18")
	)
	(text "300R precharge: <=28.9mA at8.526V illustrative bound.\n8.526V is a sizing case, not an accepted pack OV limit.\nNo bypass around DSG or future RBF. Hot/pulse/SOA open."
		(at 25.4 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ff5f5307-b2f0-4501-b6b4-61b7a3ea498d")
	)
	(text "PBI needs >=2.2uF EFFECTIVE; C203 is conditional on bias/temp.\nBAT reservoir hold-up / diode hot leakage remain open.\nCG = Q203 reverse-charger clamp gate; ground bias1k."
		(at 25.4 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dc1de8bd-b6d6-436b-8831-21d25a0c892b")
	)
	(text "TI SLUSCS4C Fig9-13: common-drain CHG/DSG arrangement.\n2S: VC4/3/2 short AFTER top100R; VC1 reads midpoint.\nSRP raw side / SRN system side; C202 is differential filtering.\nNo secondary fuse or PTC selected; permanent-failure policy TBD.\nTS3/4, PRES/DISP/PTC/PTCEN and display disabled in configuration."
		(at 25.4 172.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d37ee3a1-8d60-4cb2-a264-eca71f99b8e3")
	)
	(text "R200=2mOhm1%50ppm/K1WP70; Kelvin termination/pulse/cold open.\n10M pulls retain TI driver-test load; hot leakage/turn-off open.\nFUSE/BTP tie VSS perTI; output ERC retained, no type weakening.\nFlag diamonds model actual raw sources/passive/internal paths."
		(at 25.4 240.03 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c40aa8ef-a9b8-4915-ab5d-30af8ead2414")
	)
	(text "J200 SENSE ONLY:1RAW- 2MID 3RAW+ 4TS1 5RAW- 6TS2 7RAW-.\nTwo independent103AT-2 NTCs; quiet raw returns, no MCU bypass.\nTS1/TS2 cell mode; TS2 default FET mode must change; commissioning TBD."
		(at 152.4 247.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a4c7c688-de82-4653-b406-94ac575de16d")
	)
	(text "S03/S11 API limits remain. Ratings saved in metadata/BOM; review marker retained. Not fabrication/flight qualification."
		(at 25.4 257.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "641fd55a-b77e-4983-8fe7-344aad0ac635")
	)
	(text "Q203: low-Vth ground-gate development choice.\nReverse hotplug / cold gate / hot SOA remain open."
		(at 273.05 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "563d1a2c-0a84-43b4-8a82-8d1e25308820")
	)
	(text "DSG short VGS can exceed20V; clamp / survival NOT accepted."
		(at 273.05 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d5e67e3e-65d3-437e-a179-75f0f530ba5a")
	)
	(text "PROTECTED_PACK is BEFORE future physical RBF.\nBATT_PERMITTED remains separate; NO jumper.\n35V charger-to-pack fault is NOT contained.\nBQ configuration/pack thresholds uncommissioned."
		(at 304.8 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
