  (text "ISOLATED BUS POWER CANDIDATE\n3V3_BMS_ISO now supplies\nISO1540 side2 and pullups.\nRAW/system returns remain\nseparate across the shunt.\nPrior shared-positive supply\nhas been removed. Gauging,\nstartup, calibration and\nfault/PVT acceptance OPEN."
    (at 365.76 111.76 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "6fa87208-f163-475e-8979-8257707fe199")
  )
  (text "100kbit/s: side1 <=40pF, side2 <=200pF.\nBoth sides >=3V +1ms before polling.\nReserve 13.8mA IC +3.431mA pullups.\nStatic margins only; no rail-step proof.\nIsolated supply is a development candidate."
    (at 340.36 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "34addeb4-8586-4f44-9e3f-aeb194f2a542")
  )
